        {
          "name": "Ashen Blight",
          "type": "su",
          "description": "3/day, a mahadeva creates ash to erupt around it's foes. All enemies within 30 feet of the mahadeva suffer the effects of Blindga. (Will save DC 20) Blue mages may learn this ability as a 3rd level spell (Knowledge: Religion DC 21).",
